  Notation WF l := (l AI L RNG st LB ra sp gp tp s0 s1 s2 s3 s4 s5 s6 s7 s8 s9 s10 s11 FR fc m0 DST dcap SS DT mtl lo src cbs pdt pb
                      SBL SBH AH HDT HDB LOA LOS SPT SP16 LCB MTL DC NSM SBB SBA DJ1 DJ2 UDT UDB USB
                      WSK WIM WDT WDB WSB WDTS WDBS WSBS).

  Lemma w4f_ff : 0x10007fff8000 <= SPF /\ SP <= 2^47 /\ lo + 8192 <= SP /\ DST + dcap <= SPF /\ SS + n <= SPF
